AGR|fuel_type|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor (uranium dioxide pellets, 2.5-3.5% enriched)
AGR|moderator|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor (graphite moderator)
AGR|coolant|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor (carbon dioxide coolant)
AGR|operating_pressure_bar|CONFIRMED||MED|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor: "pressure of around 40 bar"; corroborated by second search giving 41 bar mean pressure
AGR|enrichment_pct|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor (2.5-3.5% enriched uranium dioxide)
AGR|core_height_m|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Web search: Heysham II/Torness AGR technical description (active core height 8.3 m); Hinkley B also cited at 8.3 m
AGR|core_diameter_m|WRONG|9.5|MED|Web search: Heysham II/Torness AGR technical description (active core diameter 9.5 m) - DB value 9.3 does not match either Hinkley B (9.1m) or Heysham II/Torness (9.5m) variant that matches on all other fields (1623 MWth, 332 channels)
AGR|number_of_fuel_assemblies|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Web search: Heysham II/Torness AGR technical description (332 fuel channels)
AGR|outlet_temperature_c|CONFIRMED||HIGH|Wikipedia Advanced Gas-cooled Reactor (mean hot coolant temperature designed as 648C); corroborated by second source (292C in / 645C out at 41 bar)
AGR|inlet_temperature_c|CONFIRMED||HIGH|WebSearch synthesis of AGR design parameters: "CO2 inlet temperatures of 292C"
AGR|number_of_steam_generators|UNVERIFIABLE||LOW|Only "four boiler quadrants" confirmed (large.stanford.edu AGR description); exact total boiler/steam-generator unit count of 8 not confirmed
AGR|fuel_assembly_type|CONFIRMED||MED|WebSearch synthesis of AGR fuel design (36 stainless-steel-clad fuel pins per element, assemblies referred to as "stringers" in AGR literature)
AGR|average_burnup_mwd_per_t|CONFIRMED||HIGH|WebSearch on Hinkley Point B burnup: "fuel enabling higher burn-up rates of up to 18,000 MWd/tU"; UK AGR fleet historically achieved 18,000-23,000 MWd/MTU
AGR|number_of_turbines|CONFIRMED||MED|WebSearch synthesis: "turbo-alternators rated for 660 MWe" - one per reactor unit at Heysham II/Torness
AGR|turbine_speed_rpm|UNVERIFIABLE||LOW|Only generic engineering background found (50Hz grid full-speed = 3000rpm); no AGR-specific source confirmed this figure
AGR|low_pressure_sections|UNVERIFIABLE||LOW|Not confirmed by any retrieved AGR source
AGR|live_steam_pressure_bar|CONFIRMED||HIGH|OSTI: "Heysham II/Torness AGR Steam Generators" (A.N. Charcharos) - "steam is generated at 538C/160 bar(a)"
